*> Решето Эратосфена: таблица флагов «вычеркнуто» для чисел 1..50.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SIEVE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-N         PIC 9(4) VALUE 50.
01 WS-FLAGS.
   05 WS-CROSSED PIC 9 OCCURS 50 TIMES VALUE 0.
01 WS-P         PIC 9(4).
01 WS-K         PIC 9(4).
01 WS-OUT       PIC Z(17)9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Primes up to 50:" WITH NO ADVANCING
    PERFORM VARYING WS-P FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL WS-P > WS-N
        IF WS-CROSSED(WS-P) = 0
            MOVE WS-P TO WS-OUT
            DISPLAY " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OUT) WITH NO ADVANCING
            PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM WS-P BY WS-P UNTIL WS-K > WS-N
                MOVE 1 TO WS-CROSSED(WS-K)
            END-PERFORM
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY SPACE
    STOP RUN.
